# CORE CONTEXT

You are building a professional SaaS platform for technical project coordination in construction.

This is NOT a generic CRUD system.

This system manages:
- Technical documentation
- Version control
- Approval workflows
- Auditability
- Multi-company collaboration

## CORE PRINCIPLE

The system is built around the concept of:

> THREAD = SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH

A thread represents a technical topic and contains:
- ONE main document
- Optional secondary documents
- Linear version history
- Comments
- RFI
- Approval status

## NON-NEGOTIABLE RULES

- Only ONE "APTO" version per thread
- Versioning is LINEAR (no branching)
- No rollback allowed
- Documents are immutable
- Everything must be auditable
- Nothing is deleted, only marked as SUPERSEDED

## DEVELOPMENT MINDSET

You are not coding fast.

You are designing a system used in real construction projects where mistakes cost millions.

Every decision must prioritize:
- Traceability
- Clarity
- Robustness

## OUTPUT EXPECTATION

- Clean architecture
- Strong typing
- Explicit logic (no magic)
- Production-ready code